      "content": "That sounds good for the main pitch, but I was looking through some of the raw geotechnical data earlier and I saw some notes about soil liquefaction risk during seismic events. If the zoning board sees that, they're going to tank the whole permit. How should we address those specific findings in the report so they don't become a dealbreaker?",
